sing args)\u001b[39m                                                   \u001b[38;5;252mdo not import\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mAny non-zero exit means TARGET is the \u001b[3mprevious\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m file, so gate the import on the exit code\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m\u2014 that is what keeps stale and partial data out in one rule.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;252mCommand to use\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m \u001b[38;5;182mcd\u001b[38;5;255m \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b\\/tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b[0m\u001b[48;5;234m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\                                                                           \u001b[49m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/run_report.sh\u001b\\./run_report.sh\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ TARGET.csv EXPORT.csv --month 2026-10 --category FOOD --csv --strict |\u001b[39m                                              \u001b[49m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m   { rc=${PIPESTATUS[0]\u001b[38;5;182m:-\u001b[38;5;255m${?}}; }\u001b[39m                                                                                                    \u001b[49m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mSimpler and reliable \u2014 separate the run from the import:\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m \u001b[38;5;182mif\u001b[38;5;255m \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/run_report.sh\u001b\\./run_report.sh\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ TARGET.csv EXPORT.csv --month 2026-10 --category FOOD --csv --strict; \u001b[38;5;182mthen\u001b[39m                                       \u001b[49m \u001b[38;5;252m\u276e\r\n\u001b[39m    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m     import TARGET.csv        \u001b[38;5;103m# only on exit 0: guaranteed fresh and complete for the month\u001b[39m                                          \u001b[49m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m \u001b[38;5;182melse\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                \u001b[49m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m     \u001b[38;5;182mecho\u001b[38;5;255m \u001b[38;5;151m\"skip import (exit \u001b[38;5;255m$?\u001b[38;5;151m), TARGET unchanged\"\u001b[38;5;255m >&\u001b[38;5;187m2\u001b[39m                                                                              \u001b[49m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;102m\u258f\u001b[38;5;255m\u001b[48;5;234m \u001b[38;5;182mfi\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                  \u001b[49m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mOne caveat: a valid month with no matching rows would also exit 0 with an empty report \u2014\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mthat's fresh, not stale, so it imports correctly; only non-zero exits are the \"do not\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mimport\" signal.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;146m\u203a \u001b[38;5;110mPlease remove the confusing pipeline example. Give only a tested if/then pattern that runs the import step on exit 0 and skips it on\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mevery failure. Preserve the original nonzero exit status in the failure branch so cron reports the failure. Demonstrate the failure\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mpath locally with a harmless marker standing in for the importer; do not contact any external service.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mtesting the if/then wrapper's failure and success paths locally\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;103m$ set -u P=/tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project D=/tmp/safeimport-demo\u001b[39m                            \u001b[38;5;235m\u2191\u001b[38;5;243m 85.8k\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;238m\u2193\u001b[38;5;252m 3,250\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2500 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;116mdeepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m (together):auto \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;173m\u25c7 YOLO\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;252m$0.40\u001b[38;5;243m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;252m\u27f2 86% cached\u001b[38;5;243m   \u001b[38;5;252m85.8k/1M \u00b7 8%\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;243m58 tok/s \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;146m\u2839\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;146mworking\u001b[38;5;243m \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;146m11s\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;243m\u203a \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n \u001b[38;5;116mesc\u001b[38;5;243m interrupt\u001b[39m                                                              \u001b[38;5;243mproject: /tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b[39m"]
