                                                                                                \u001b[49m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mExit 0 is the only importable state; every non-zero exit skips the import and leaves the\u001b[39m                                                 \u001b[38;5;252m\u276e\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252mprevious target in place.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mDemonstrated locally (no external service; \u001b[48;5;234mtouch imported.marker\u001b[49m stood in for the\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mimporter):\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m\u00b7\u001b[38;5;252m Failure \u2014 export had a rejected \u001b[48;5;234minf\u001b[49m row: \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/run_report.sh\u001b\\run_report.sh\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ exited 2, the wrapper printed\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  \u001b[48;5;234mno import: report refused (exit 2)\u001b[49m, the wrapper exited \u001b[1m2\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m, the marker was \u001b[1mnot\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m created,\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  and \u001b[48;5;234mtarget.csv\u001b[49m kept its old \u001b[48;5;234mOLD-STALE\u001b[49m contents.\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;102m\u00b7\u001b[38;5;252m Success \u2014 clean export: wrapper exited \u001b[1m0\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m, marker created, target replaced with\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m  \u001b[48;5;234mcategory,amount / food,42.50 / TOTAL,42.50\u001b[49m.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mSo \u001b[48;5;234mrc=$?\u001b[49m sits on the first line of the \u001b[48;5;234melse\u001b[49m branch, before any other command, and \u001b[48;5;234mexit\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[48;5;234m\"$rc\"\u001b[49m hands that 2 (or 1, or 64) back to cron.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u00b7 1 file \u00b7 \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/HANDOFF.md\u001b\\HANDOFF.md\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\